# LF everywhere, whatever core.autocrlf says (#81): the build, biome and the docs tests compare
# text and expect LF. The repo has no binary files today; the patterns below keep any that get
# added out of line-ending conversion.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.wasm binary
